# ZXV UI message catalog: Arabic (ar), Modern Standard Arabic. Official AU
# and UN language. Right-to-left: i18n_format_msg() isolates each {n}
# argument with FSI/PDI. Arabic has six plural forms (CLDR: zero, one, two,
# few = 3..10, many = 11..99, other = 100+); every plural message lists all
# six. Every line is a MACHINE translation and NEEDS NATIVE REVIEW.
# Format: see en.msg.

